<UserControl x:Class="SukiUI.Demo.Features.Helpers.Skeumorphism.SkeumorphismPage"
             xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
             xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
             xmlns:suki="https://github.com/kikipoulet/SukiUI"
             xmlns:skeumorphism="clr-namespace:SukiUI.Demo.Features.Helpers.Skeumorphism"
             xmlns:controls="clr-namespace:SukiUI.Demo.Features.Helpers.Skeumorphism.Controls"
             d:DesignHeight="450"
             d:DesignWidth="800"
             x:DataType="skeumorphism:SkeumorphismViewModel"
             mc:Ignorable="d">
    <UserControl.DataContext>
        <skeumorphism:SkeumorphismViewModel />
    </UserControl.DataContext>

    <StackPanel Margin="50,25" Spacing="20">

        <TextBlock Classes="h2">Skeumorphism</TextBlock>

        <Border Height="1"
                Margin="0,-45,0,20"
                Background="{DynamicResource SukiControlBorderBrush}" />

        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap">
            Skeumo-Suki is mostly a skill written for an LLM: a guide that lets it build skeuomorphic controls that blend into SukiUI instead of clashing with it. The metal takes the tint of the theme, a single soft light matches the glass of the cards, and the accent color stays the energy of the object. What you see below is what the skill produces.
        </TextBlock>
        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap">
            It is not the historical skeuomorphism, which dressed a note-taking app as a notebook to reassure people at the first steps of digitalization. Here, skeuomorphism draws a border between the real and the abstract. A flat green light probably means that something is open in the software; a skeuomorphic lamp means that something is switched on in the real world. When the user handles a real device (a pump, a motor, a camera, a battery), the object on screen says so at a glance: this is not a setting, it acts on something physical. That is the point of Skeumo-Suki skill. It only became practical because LLMs have become remarkably good at drawing: a complex control now takes a few minutes where it would take weeks of painstaking vector work, which few developers know how to do, and this is why each control is a black box with a very clear API, its drawing and animation isolated in a separate Rendering.cs.
        </TextBlock>
  
  

        <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
            <suki:GlassCard Width="320" Margin="20" Padding="16" TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource SukiText}">
                <StackPanel>
                    <!-- Header: title + level badge -->
                    <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="17" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="Tank" />
                        <suki:GlassCard Grid.Column="1" Padding="10,3" CornerRadius="10">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                <Border Width="7" Height="7" VerticalAlignment="Center" CornerRadius="4"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource SukiPrimaryColor}" />
                                <TextBlock FontSize="11" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="{Binding LevelText}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </suki:GlassCard>
                    </Grid>

                    <!-- Scene: the outlet of the tank runs under the lever -->
                    <Panel Width="288" Height="200" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                        <controls:Tank Level="{Binding Level}"
                                       Inflow="{Binding Inflow}"
                                       Outflow="{Binding Outflow}" />
                        <controls:SpringLever Margin="0,46,0,0"
                                              HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                                              VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                              LeftLabel="Fill"
                                              RightLabel="Drain"
                                              AutomationProperties.Name="Fill and drain lever"
                                              Value="{Binding LeverValue}"
                                              Released="Lever_OnReleased" />
                    </Panel>
                </StackPanel>
            </suki:GlassCard>

            <!-- Camera: display + hinge slider for the exposure -->
            <suki:GlassCard Width="300" Margin="20" Padding="16" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                            TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource SukiText}">
                <StackPanel>
                    <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="17" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="Camera" />
                        <suki:GlassCard Grid.Column="1" Padding="10,3" CornerRadius="10">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                <Border Width="7" Height="7" VerticalAlignment="Center" CornerRadius="4"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource SukiPrimaryColor}" />
                                <TextBlock FontSize="11" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="{Binding FpsText}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </suki:GlassCard>
                    </Grid>

                    <controls:Camera Margin="0,20,0,5"
                                     Exposure="{Binding Exposure}"
                                     Gain="{Binding Gain}"
                                     Fps="{Binding Fps}" />

                    <Grid Margin="0,35,0,4" ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="13" FontWeight="Medium" Text="Exposure" />
                        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="14"
                                   FontWeight="SemiBold" Text="{Binding ExposureText}" />
                    </Grid>
                    <controls:HingeSlider Steps="{Binding ExposureSteps}"
                                          Value="{Binding Exposure}"
                                          AutomationProperties.Name="Exposure (µs)" />
                </StackPanel>
            </suki:GlassCard>

            <!-- Syringe: drag the plunger, click the valve -->
            <suki:GlassCard Width="300" Margin="20" Padding="0,16" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                            TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource SukiText}">
                <StackPanel>
                    <Grid Margin="16,0" ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="17" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="Syringe" />
                        <suki:GlassCard Grid.Column="1" Padding="10,3" CornerRadius="10">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                <Border Width="7" Height="7" VerticalAlignment="Center" CornerRadius="4"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource SukiPrimaryColor}" />
                                <TextBlock FontSize="11" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="{Binding SyringeVolumeText}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </suki:GlassCard>
                    </Grid>

                    <controls:Syringe Margin="0,12,0,0"
                                      Position="{Binding SyringePosition}"
                                      Flow="{Binding SyringeFlow}"
                                      IsValveOut="{Binding IsValveOut}"
                                      Volume="{Binding SyringeVolume}"
                                      PositionRequested="Syringe_OnPositionRequested"
                                      ValveToggleRequested="Syringe_OnValveToggleRequested" />
                </StackPanel>
            </suki:GlassCard>

            <!-- Speed: three-notch switch, drives the syringe stroke speed -->
            <suki:GlassCard Width="300" Margin="20" Padding="16" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                            TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource SukiText}">
                <StackPanel>
                    <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="17" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="Speed" />
                        <suki:GlassCard Grid.Column="1" Padding="10,3" CornerRadius="10">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                <Border Width="7" Height="7" VerticalAlignment="Center" CornerRadius="4"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource SukiPrimaryColor}" />
                                <TextBlock FontSize="11" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="{Binding SpeedText}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </suki:GlassCard>
                    </Grid>

                    <suki:GlassCard Height="100" Margin="0,16,0,0" Padding="0" CornerRadius="14">
                        <controls:NotchSwitch HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                              TopLabel="Fast"
                                              MiddleLabel="Medium"
                                              BottomLabel="Slow"
                                              AutomationProperties.Name="Syringe speed"
                                              SelectedIndex="{Binding SpeedIndex}" />
                    </suki:GlassCard>
                </StackPanel>
            </suki:GlassCard>

            <!-- Fan + rotary knob: the knob sets the speed through the wire, the motor ramps up -->
            <suki:GlassCard Width="350" Margin="20" Padding="16" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                            TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource SukiText}">
                <StackPanel>
                    <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="17" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="Fan" />
                        <suki:GlassCard Grid.Column="1" Padding="10,3" CornerRadius="10">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                <Border Width="7" Height="7" VerticalAlignment="Center" CornerRadius="4"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource SukiPrimaryColor}" />
                                <TextBlock FontSize="11" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="{Binding FanRpmText}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </suki:GlassCard>
                    </Grid>
                    <!-- Scene 318 x 200: speed controller terminal (258,142) -> wire -> fan gland (128,166) -->
                    <Panel Width="318" Height="200" Margin="0,20,0,0">
                        <controls:Fan HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top" Speed="{Binding FanSpeed}" />
                        <controls:Wire Data="M 258,142 C 258,196 132,198 128,166" Trigger="{Binding FanSetting}" />
                        <controls:RotaryKnob Margin="198,20,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                             Minimum="0" Maximum="10" StepCount="10"
                                             AutomationProperties.Name="Fan speed"
                                             Value="{Binding FanSetting}" />
                    </Panel>
                </StackPanel>
            </suki:GlassCard>

            <!-- Battery + guarded toggle: lift the cover, throw the switch to charge -->
            <suki:GlassCard Width="320" Margin="20" Padding="16" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                            TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource SukiText}">
                <StackPanel>
                    <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="17" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="Battery" />
                        <suki:GlassCard Grid.Column="1" Padding="10,3" CornerRadius="10">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                <Border Width="7" Height="7" VerticalAlignment="Center" CornerRadius="4"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource SukiPrimaryColor}" />
                                <TextBlock FontSize="11" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="{Binding ChargeText}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </suki:GlassCard>
                    </Grid>
                    <!-- Scene 288 x 200: supply from the left edge -> switch (terminals 30,32 / 80,32) -> battery + (202,26);
                         return from the battery - (254,26) to the right edge -->
                    <Panel Width="288" Height="200" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                        <controls:GuardedToggle Margin="0,30,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                RequiresCover="True" AutomationProperties.Name="Charger"
                                                IsOn="{Binding ChargerOn}" />
                        <controls:Battery Margin="168,20,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                          Charge="{Binding Charge}" IsCharging="{Binding IsCharging}" />
                        <controls:Wire Data="M -4,10 C 18,10 30,14 30,32" Insulation="Red" FadeStart="True"
                                       Current="{Binding ChargeCurrent}" />
                        <controls:Wire Data="M 80,32 C 80,4 202,2 202,26" Insulation="Red"
                                       Current="{Binding ChargeCurrent}" />
                    </Panel>
                </StackPanel>
            </suki:GlassCard>

            <!-- Stirrer + three-position selector: OFF / SLOW / FAST, wired to the stirrer -->
            <suki:GlassCard Width="320" Margin="20" Padding="16" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                            TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource SukiText}">
                <StackPanel>
                    <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="17" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="Stirrer" />
                        <suki:GlassCard Grid.Column="1" Padding="10,3" CornerRadius="10">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                <Border Width="7" Height="7" VerticalAlignment="Center" CornerRadius="4"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource SukiPrimaryColor}" />
                                <TextBlock FontSize="11" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="{Binding StirRpmText}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </suki:GlassCard>
                    </Grid>
                    <!-- Scene 288 x 210: selector terminal (270,198) -> wire -> stirrer gland (171,166) -->
                    <Panel Width="288" Height="210" Margin="0,16,0,0">
                        <controls:Stirrer HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                          Speed="{Binding StirSpeed}" MaxRpm="1500" />
                        <controls:Wire Data="M 270,198 C 240,198 200,170 171,166" Trigger="{Binding StirMode}" />
                        <controls:TriSwitch Margin="186,152,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                            LeftLabel="OFF" MiddleLabel="SLOW" RightLabel="FAST"
                                            AutomationProperties.Name="Stir speed" SelectedIndex="{Binding StirMode}" />
                    </Panel>
                </StackPanel>
            </suki:GlassCard>

            <!-- Lamp + rocker switch: the switch powers the lamp through the wire -->
            <suki:GlassCard Width="320" Margin="20" Padding="16" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                            TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource SukiText}">
                <StackPanel>
                    <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="17" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="Lamp" />
                        <suki:GlassCard Grid.Column="1" Padding="10,3" CornerRadius="10">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                <Border Width="7" Height="7" VerticalAlignment="Center" CornerRadius="4"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource SukiPrimaryColor}" />
                                <TextBlock FontSize="11" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="{Binding LampText}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </suki:GlassCard>
                    </Grid>
                    <!-- Scene 288 x 230: mains from the right edge -> switch terminal (256,180); switch (224,180) -> lamp foot (136,210) -->
                    <Panel Width="288" Height="230" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                        <controls:Lamp HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top" Intensity="{Binding LampPower}" />
                        <controls:RockerSwitch Margin="200,60,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                               AutomationProperties.Name="Lamp switch" IsOn="{Binding LampOn}" />
                        <controls:Wire Data="M 292,224 C 272,224 256,214 256,182" Insulation="Red" FadeStart="True"
                                       Current="{Binding LampPower}" />
                        <controls:Wire Data="M 224,182 C 224,216 168,214 136,210" Insulation="Red"
                                       Current="{Binding LampPower}" />
                    </Panel>
                </StackPanel>
            </suki:GlassCard>

            <!-- Network: the map only plays the scenario of the chosen protocol and reports its progress -->
            <suki:GlassCard Width="320" Margin="20" Padding="16" VerticalAlignment="Top"
                            TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource SukiText}">
                <StackPanel>
                    <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto">
                        <TextBlock VerticalAlignment="Center" FontSize="17" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="Local network" />
                        <suki:GlassCard Grid.Column="1" Padding="10,3" CornerRadius="10">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                <Border Width="7" Height="7" VerticalAlignment="Center" CornerRadius="4"
                                        Background="{DynamicResource SukiPrimaryColor}" />
                                <TextBlock FontSize="11" FontWeight="DemiBold" Text="{Binding NetworkBadge}" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </suki:GlassCard>
                    </Grid>

                    <!-- Scene 288 x 222 -->
                    <controls:NetworkMap Margin="0,16,0,0"
                                         HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                         Width="288" Height="222"
                                         Script="{Binding NetworkScript}"
                                         StepIndex="{Binding NetworkStepIndex, Mode=OneWayToSource}"
                                         IsPlaying="{Binding IsNetworkPlaying, Mode=OneWayToSource}" />

                    <TextBlock Height="52" Margin="0,12,0,0" FontSize="12" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                               Classes.Playing="{Binding IsNetworkPlaying}"
                               Text="{Binding NetworkCaption}">
                        <TextBlock.Styles>
                            <Style Selector="TextBlock">
                                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource SukiLowText}" />
                            </Style>
                            <Style Selector="TextBlock.Playing">
                                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource SukiText}" />
                            </Style>
                        </TextBlock.Styles>
                    </TextBlock>

                    <ItemsControl Margin="-3,8,-3,0" ItemsSource="{Binding NetworkProtocols}">
                        <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                            <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                <UniformGrid Columns="3" />
                            </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                        </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                        <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                            <DataTemplate x:DataType="skeumorphism:NetworkProtocol">
                                <Button Margin="3" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center"
                                        Classes="Flat" Classes.Accent="{Binding IsActive}"
                                        Padding="4,6" FontSize="12"
                                        Command="{Binding RunCommand}"
                                        IsEnabled="{Binding !IsBlocked}"
                                        Content="{Binding Label}"
                                        ToolTip.Tip="{Binding Description}" />
                            </DataTemplate>
                        </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                    </ItemsControl>
                </StackPanel>
            </suki:GlassCard>
        </WrapPanel>
    </StackPanel>
</UserControl>
